[37m[40m│ [97mUsing the MS-DOS Editor:[37m                                                     [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│                                                                              [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│   ■ To activate the MS-DOS Editor menu bar, press Alt.                       [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│   ■ To activate menus and commands, press the highlighted letter.            [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│   ■ To move between menus and commands, use the direction keys.              [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│   ■ To get help on a selected menu, command, or dialog box, press F1.        [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│   ■ To exit Help, press Esc.                                                 [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│                                                                              [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│ [97mBrowsing the MS-DOS Editor Help system:[37m                                      [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│                                                                              [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│   ■ To select one of the following topics, press the Tab key or the first    [30m[47m░
[37m[40m│     letter of the topic. Then press the Enter key to see information on:     [30m[47m░
